> Some things you do to a fountain anger the guards even if they can't
> see you do it!

You aren't allowed to do things that destroy fountains, I think.  That
includes drying them up by overuse.  In minetown only, fountain flows
will reduce to a trickle when they have one use left so just make sure
to stop using it if that happens.  If you do destroy a fountain on
minetown, it doesn't matter if you're visible to them or not, a
whistle will sound and the guards'll come running.

Often by the time I hit minetown, if my pet's still alive, it's strong
enough to handle watchmen, if not the watch captain.  As long as any
of them are still around they'll become angry if you do something that
removes a fountain from the level.

